WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.013 --> 00:00:16.196
- [Voiceover] You can
be pursuing a profession

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:19.246
because your parents
say it's the best thing.

00:00:19.246 --> 00:00:20.337
You can be pursuing a profession

00:00:20.337 --> 00:00:23.229
because you think you'll
make a lot of money.

00:00:23.229 --> 00:00:24.654
You can be pursuing a profession

00:00:24.654 --> 00:00:27.385
because you think you're going
to get a lot of attention.

00:00:27.385 --> 00:00:29.435
None of that will do you any good

00:00:29.435 --> 00:00:33.052
if you are not being honest with yourself.

00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:35.014
Oprah Winfrey.

00:00:35.014 --> 00:00:39.051
Most people waste their lives
living someone else's dream.

00:00:39.051 --> 00:00:40.888
They imprison themselves by accepting

00:00:40.888 --> 00:00:43.520
the results of other people's thinking.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.144
They allow the opinions of others

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:47.703
to crush their own inner voice.

00:00:47.703 --> 00:00:49.969
You might have been beaten down so often

00:00:49.969 --> 00:00:52.347
that now you stomp out your own dreams

00:00:52.347 --> 00:00:55.422
before they even have a chance to blossom.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:58.598
You have become your own little man.

00:00:58.598 --> 00:01:01.286
It's time to rediscover yourself.

00:01:01.286 --> 00:01:02.692
The ancient Greeks had a proverb,

00:01:02.692 --> 00:01:05.109
Gnothi Seauton, know thyself.

00:01:06.212 --> 00:01:09.081
It was used as a warning
to pay no attention

00:01:09.081 --> 00:01:11.799
to the opinion of the masses.

00:01:11.799 --> 00:01:15.304
It's a valuable reminder
that this is your life.

00:01:15.304 --> 00:01:17.359
You need to take charge.

00:01:17.359 --> 00:01:20.076
If you want success, if you
want to accomplish your goals,

00:01:20.076 --> 00:01:21.945
if you want your life to mean something

00:01:21.945 --> 00:01:24.235
and to have a significant impact,

00:01:24.235 --> 00:01:27.763
you start by digging
deep to know yourself,

00:01:27.763 --> 00:01:30.271
to find your one word,
and to set your course

00:01:30.271 --> 00:01:32.604
in a powerful new direction.

00:01:33.645 --> 00:01:36.262
For some people it's really
easy and they get it right away.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.974
For others, like myself, it takes time,

00:01:38.974 --> 00:01:42.188
analysis, and exercises to narrow it down.

00:01:42.188 --> 00:01:44.321
If you don't do a lot of
regular self-reflection,

00:01:44.321 --> 00:01:48.035
this will be a challenging
activity, but totally worth it.

00:01:48.035 --> 00:01:49.618
When I found my one word,

00:01:49.618 --> 00:01:52.535
it changed my business and my life.

